  "description": "Local-first media manager that auto-catalogs files as you open them. AI-powered tagging for images, games \u0026 apps. Built with Electron + Vue 3. 本地优先的 AI小抽屉 (AI资源管家) — 自动记录你打开过的文件，AI 智能打标签，告别手动整理。",
